5	// state and GET /healthz to prove that entry is untouched) and back the
6	// conclusions in docs/query-input-decoding-analysis.md: how repeated query
7	// parameters, percent-decoded parameter names, case sensitivity, '+' versus
8	// '%2B' and the trim boundary turn a raw request URI into a dispatched
9	// repository/tag/digest query — or into the published 400. They deliberately
10	// avoid the store's unexported internals so that any refactor preserving the
11	// published contract keeps them green.
